Z||000009||fieroshop||01-02-2000||02:40 PM||||It sounds like you have a bad connection to the injector. My 88GT did that and it was a disconnected plug on top of the injector and I've had that problem with several other Fieros that come to the shop.||||reg||1
Z||000010||Gokart||01-03-2000||08:54 PM||||That's what it was! No.1 injector plug unconnected. Thanks to Cobra for coming over today and finding the prob. and numerous other things you found for me! I wish everyone had a forum buddy that lived as close as Cobra and I do! Just wish we had the same color red so I could pull the ol' "swap the car when he turns his back" trick!! MAN...his GT still looks showroom! Plus the goodies!!||||reg||14
